SUMMARY:Humanity AI Phase 1 application due
UID:a95d1a9b-e862-4456-9705-af3252421ea5@a95d.org
DESCRIPTION:Partner-outreach drafts for this grant application are 
 finished\nand ready but unsent\, pending the user's approval\; no 
 partners\nare named in the outline yet\, which is the weakest 
 scoring\narea. Filing is targeted for Oct 19-20 ahead of this deadline.
