 include an\nearlier opening of the payment-failure window\, a banked-
 hours\ndispute in a contract thread\, a lapsed autodeposit\nregistration\,
  and a storage-limit deletion warning whose\ndate has passed. Checkpoint 
 paused for resume from batch 96.
DTSTAMP:20261013T223317Z
